00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:30.100
How does Google Cloud make the
developer experience easier?

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.400
Well, first, our services
integrate nicely,

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.420
giving you a full stack
that's specifically

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:41.950
tailored to backend, web,
mobile, and data analytics

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.630
applications.

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:48.460
The stack aligns Google Cloud's
Compute, Storage, Database,

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:53.650
