time to market.

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:20.150
But down the road, it also
means that we proactively

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:23.780
solve your day-two and
day-three challenges, challenges

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:27.650
like scalability, observability,
