00:25:02.640 --> 00:25:04.110
We added these new
features to help

00:25:04.110 --> 00:25:06.960
you build more powerful
applications on top of Chat,

00:25:06.960 --> 00:25:08.880
and it's immediately
obvious how helpful

00:25:08.880 --> 00:25:11.220
