version of Meet

00:27:37.360 --> 00:27:40.060
to simultaneously show the
meeting in the same view

00:27:40.060 --> 00:27:41.530
as your content.

00:27:41.530 --> 00:27:44.080
And yes, I said cross-platform.

00:27:44.080 --> 00:27:47.530
Anywhere you can run Meet, which
is pretty much anywhere-- web,

00:27:47.530 --> 00:27:50.080
Android, iOS, even Chromecast--

00:27:50.080 --> 00:27:53.290
you can integrate and
experience live sharing.

00:27:53.290 --> 00:27:55.300
I'm sure you'd love
to get more details,

00:27:55.300 --> 00:27:57.400
and we have a lot more to share.

00:27:57.400 --> 00:28:00.250
Learn how to enable shared
experiences across platforms

00:28:00.250 --> 00:28:05.687
in a session presented by PMs
from Google Meet and YouTube.

00:28:05.687 --> 00:28:08.270
When you've built an integration
using one of the new features

00:28:08.270 --> 00:28:12.830
above or our already great
Gmail, Drive, or Calendar APIs,

00:28:12.830 --> 00:28:15.460
you'll then focus
on distribution.

00:28:15.460 --> 00:28:18.070
For that, the Google
Workspace Marketplace

00:28:18.070 --> 00:28:20.680
is the place where you
can have global visibility

00:28:20.680 --> 00:28:22.870
with all Workspace users.

00:28:22.870 --> 00:28:24.580
We've seen billions
of app installs

00:28:24.580 --> 00:28:28.000
by Workspace users and thousands
of apps published by developers

00:28:28.000 --> 00:28:30.202
in the Marketplace.

00:28:30.202 --> 00:28:32.160
But what if you're building
a private app meant

00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:34.132
for your company only?

00:28:34.132 --> 00:28:35.840
Perhaps it's that
custom desk booking app

00:28:35.840 --> 00:28:37.890
that we've seen a lot of today.

00:28:37.890 --> 00:28:39.990
Fortunately, the
Marketplace is also

00:28:39.990 --> 00:28:42.822
designed to be the vehicle for
deployment within a company,

00:28:42.822 --> 00:28:44.280
either through
administrator-driven

00:28:44.280 --> 00:28:47.460
deployments or through special
sections of the Marketplace,

00:28:47.460 --> 00:28:49.530
clearly indicating
internal apps approved

00:28:49.530 --> 00:28:52.270
for specific internal users.

00:28:52.270 --> 00:28:54.010
We've also made many
recent enhancements

00:28:54.010 --> 00:28:55.510
to the Marketplace.

00:28:55.510 --> 00:28:57.730
For admins, you can
now deploy Chat apps

00:28:57.730 --> 00:29:00.400
via domain-wide installation
from the Marketplace.

00:29:00.400 --> 00:29:04.030
As well, admins now have more
granular app access controls

00:29:04.030 --> 00:29:07.190
through organizational
units or groups.

00:29:07.190 --> 00:29:09.290
For end users,
admins, and anyone

00:29:09.290 --> 00:29:10.790
who is exploring
the Marketplace,

00:29:10.790 --> 00:29:13.880
we strengthened transparency
and disclosure, improving

00:29:13.880 --> 00:29:16.670
app descriptions,
permissions, and reviews.

00:29:16.670 --> 00:29:19.010
We've also added the
Approved for you category,

00:29:19.010 --> 00:29:23.350
so users have a clear indication
of IT-approved applications.

00:29:23.350 --> 00:29:25.770
Finally, for developers
and distributors,

00:29:25.770 --> 00:29:27.690
we have enhanced the
Developer Dashboard

00:29:27.690 --> 00:29:30.390
and updated the Marketplace
badge to help discovery.

00:29:32.920 --> 00:29:36.010
Opportunity abounds with
the Workspace platform--

00:29:36.010 --> 00:29:38.440
reach billions of
users and millions

00:29:38.440 --> 00:29:40.540
of paying businesses
across the world.

00:29:40.540 --> 00:29:42.400
There are not many
platforms today

00:29:42.400 --> 00:29:45.340
that provide this scale
of reach for developers.

00:29:45.340 --> 00:29:47.470
The breadth of the
Workspace platform offering

00:29:47.470 --> 00:29:50.110
enables you to build a
wide range of solutions,

00:29:50.110 --> 00:29:52.300
build tight integrations
into all the Workspace

00:29:52.300 --> 00:29:56.020
apps for seamless experience,
create intelligent workflows

00:29:56.020 --> 00:30:00.250
using Chat, transform business
data accessible via dozens

00:30:00.250 --> 00:30:04.510
of APIs into strategic
insights, use a single identity

00:30:04.510 --> 00:30:06.590
across many services.

00:30:06.590 --> 00:30:09.580
And finally, impact--
customers choose Workspace

00:30:09.580 --> 00:30:12.040
because it transforms
their business and drives

00:30:12.040 --> 00:30:14.950
productivity and
strategic thinking.

00:30:14.950 --> 00:30:17.650
Add your ingenuity and insights,
and the impact we can have

00:30:17.650 --> 00:30:20.210
together is unlimited.

00:30:20.210 --> 00:30:22.850
Thanks again for joining
our Cloud team today.

00:30:22.850 --> 00:30:26.150
Here are a few links to learn
more about today's topics.

00:30:26.150 --> 00:30:28.970
We can't wait to see what you
build with Workspace and Google

00:30:28.970 --> 00:30:30.290
Cloud.

00:30:30.290 --> 00:30:32.480
Thanks, and enjoy
the rest of I/O.

